! Optics.n の PeriodicR (4x4 の一周行列から結合行列 R と x・y の面の行列 A・B)。gs と 3e-16 以内で一致
! (PeriodicR は Optics.n が読み込まれてから使える: 最初に PeriodicOptics を呼ぶ。gs も pysad も同じ)
FFS;
PageWidth=1999;
m={{0.8,1.2,0.01,0.02},{-0.3,0.9,0.03,0.01},{0.02,0.01,0.7,2.1},{0.05,0.03,-0.2,0.6}};
po=PeriodicOptics[m];
Print["R1 ",Flatten[PeriodicR[m]]];
Print["R2 ",Flatten[PeriodicR[{{0.6,2.0,0,0},{-0.3,0.8,0,0},{0,0,0.5,1.5},{0,0,-0.4,0.9}}]]];
Print["R3 ",Flatten[PeriodicR[{{0.5,3.1,0.2,0.1},{-0.2,0.7,0.3,0.4},{0.3,0.1,0.9,1.1},{0.1,0.2,-0.5,0.3}}]]];
Print["R6 ",Flatten[PeriodicR[{{-0.4,3.1,0.2,0.1},{-0.2,-0.7,0.3,0.4},{0.3,0.1,-0.9,1.1},{0.1,0.2,-0.5,-0.3}}]]];
Print["R8 ",Flatten[PeriodicR[{{0.9,3.1,0,0},{-0.2,0.7,0,0},{0,0,0.2,1.1},{0,0,-0.9,0.3}}]]];
Print["R10 ",Flatten[PeriodicR[{{0.9,3.1,0.4,0.1},{-0.2,0.7,0.2,0.4},{0.5,0.1,0.2,1.1},{0.1,0.6,-0.9,0.3}}]]];
Exit;
